Description: Plex client with Jellyfin and Emby support, offline downloads, and HDR
 PlezyNG is an enhanced Plex client that also supports Jellyfin and Emby.
 Browse movies, shows, and music across your servers, search connected
 libraries, and keep watchlists and viewing progress in sync. Download media
 for offline playback. Watch Live TV and DVR where your server supports them.
 .
 Choose audio tracks and subtitles, adjust playback speed and audio sync, and
 use HDR or Dolby Vision on supported devices. Watch Together keeps playback in
 sync when everyone can access the same media on the same server.
 .
 Use PlezyNG on phones, tablets, TVs, and desktop computers. You’ll need your
 own Plex, Jellyfin, or Emby server. Features vary by server, device, and media.
